    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "Nothing could have been more annoying.",
      "translation": "没有什么比这更烦人了。",
      "startTime": 53.28,
      "endTime": 56.74
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "I picked up the receiver between two sticky fingers and was dismayed when I recognized the voice of Helen Bates.",
      "translation": "我用两个粘乎乎的手指捏起话筒，当听出是海伦·贝茨的声音时，非常沮丧。",
      "startTime": 56.75,
      "endTime": 68
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "It took me ten minutes to persuade her to ring back later. At last I hung up the receiver.",
      "translation": "我花了10分钟才说服她过一会儿再来电话。最后我挂上了话筒。",
      "startTime": 68.01,
